#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:flush_bus_updates/description:1
msgid ""
"Applies pending configuration and effect parameter changes to the runtime graph immediately. The "
"server normally does this once per frame. This call does not poll Godot AudioServer or save "
"layout files."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:sync_bypass/description:1
msgid ""
"Applies the stored bypass flag to the DSP chains of this bus's stored effect instances. The "
"channel-group fader and DSPs added separately through low-level APIs are unchanged. Use [method "
"FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_bypass] to combine bus bypass with each managed slot's enabled state."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:apply_mute/description:2
msgid ""
"Applies the stored mute flag and solo state to the channel group. The [param mute] argument means"
" that any bus in the layout is soloed; this bus is muted when that argument is [code]true[/code] "
"and its own solo flag is [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffect/methods:3/method:apply_to/description:2
msgid ""
"Applies this effect to the specified audio bus. Subclasses should override this method to add "
"their DSP units to the bus."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/constants:6/constant:MODE_ATAN
msgid "Arctangent soft clipping. Creates smooth, tube-like distortion with gradual saturation."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_release_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code skip-lint]release[/code] callback. The callable receives no "
"arguments and may return an FMOD result code. Notifications from other threads are deferred to "
"the main thread; their return values cannot affect the completed FMOD call. Pass an empty "
"[Callable] to clear it."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:set_reset_callback/description:2
msgid ""
"Assigns the custom DSP [code skip-lint]reset[/code] callback. The callable receives no arguments "
"and may return an FMOD result code. Notifications from other threads are deferred to the main "
"thread; their return values cannot affect the completed FMOD call. Pass an empty [Callable] to "
