#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:set_state/description:2
msgid ""
"Atomically replaces the bus configuration with [param state], using the format returned by "
"[method get_state]. Returns [constant OK] on success or [constant ERR_INVALID_DATA], preserving "
"the previous configuration when validation fails. The layout accepts up to 4096 buses and 512 "
"slots per bus."
msgstr ""

