#. FmodAudioEffect/description:1
msgid ""
"Base resource for FMOD audio effects such as Amplify, Filter, EQ, Reverb, and Delay. Add a "
"configuration resource to a [FmodAudioBusLayout] with [method FmodAudioBusLayout.add_bus_effect]."
" A configuration can be shared by several slots; each slot receives a separate runtime instance "
"and DSP chain. Parameter changes update the bound instances without rebuilding their DSPs.\n"
"Use [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] to read live Capture, SpectrumAnalyzer, and "
"Record data. The configuration resource stored in a layout does not hold the slot's audio buffers"
" or analysis state.\n"
"For standalone routing, apply an effect directly to a [FmodChannelGroup] with [method apply_to] "
"and detach it with [method remove_from_bus]. A directly attached effect instance belongs to one "
"bus at a time."
msgstr ""

