#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:set_mix_matrix/description:5
msgid ""
"Channel counts must be between [code]1[/code] and [code]32[/code]. [param inchannel_hop] must be "
"[code]0[/code] or between [param inchannels] and [code]32[/code]. The input must include every "
"active element; padding after the last row is optional. Invalid dimensions, strides, and short "
"arrays are rejected before calling FMOD.\n"
"Sets a custom mix matrix that maps input channels (columns) to output speaker channels (rows).\n"
"The matrix is row-major. If [param inchannel_hop] is [code]0[/code], each row is assumed to "
"contain [param inchannels] values."
