#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_reverb_3d/description:1
msgid ""
"Creates a 3D reverb zone for spatial audio reverberation effects.\n"
"Returns a [FmodReverb3D] object that can be positioned in 3D space and configured with reverb "
"parameters.\n"
"Use this to create environmental audio effects like caves, halls, or rooms."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_dsp_by_type/description:2
msgid ""
"Creates a DSP effect of the specified built-in type. Use [method get_dsp_info_by_type] to query "
"available DSP types and their information."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_sound_from_res/description:4
msgid ""
"Creates a [FmodSound] from a Godot resource path (starting with [code]res://[/code]). The file is"
" loaded through Godot's file system and then passed to FMOD.\n"
"The mode parameter specifies creation options using [enum FmodMode] flags."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_sound_from_file/description:4
msgid ""
"Creates a [FmodSound] from a file path. If the path starts with [code]res://[/code], it will use "
"[method create_sound_from_res] internally.\n"
"The mode parameter specifies creation options using [enum FmodMode] flags, such as looping "
"behavior ([constant FMOD_MODE_LOOP_NORMAL]), 3D positioning ([constant FMOD_MODE_3D]), or "
"streaming ([constant FMOD_MODE_CREATESTREAM])."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_sound_from_memory/description:4
msgid ""
"Creates a [FmodSound] from audio data loaded in memory and adds [constant FMOD_MODE_OPENMEMORY] "
"to [param mode]. The returned sound retains the data array, so the caller does not need to keep a"
" separate reference to it.\n"
"The mode parameter specifies creation options using [enum FmodMode] flags."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_CREATECOMPRESSEDSAMPLE
msgid ""
"Creates a compressed sample that stays compressed in memory, decoding in real-time during "
"playback. Saves memory but uses more CPU."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_dsp_connection/description:2
msgid ""
"Creates a connection for [method FmodDSP.add_input_preallocated]. Configure the mix or matrix "
"before attaching it. The FMOD system owns the connection; disconnecting it invalidates the "
"handle."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_dsp/description:6
msgid ""
"Creates a custom FMOD 2.04 filter or generator. Cooldown is measured in sample frames. A channel "
"count of zero follows the input/system format. Set the sample callback using [method "
"FmodDSP.set_process_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_geometry/description:3
msgid ""
"Creates a geometry object for 3D occlusion calculations.\n"
"Geometry is used to simulate sound occlusion by physical objects in the scene."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_channel_group/description:2
msgid ""
"Creates a new [FmodChannelGroup] with the specified name. Channel groups allow you to organize "
"channels for collective control of volume, pitch, and effects."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_sound_group/description:2
msgid ""
"Creates a new [FmodSoundGroup] with the specified name.\n"
"Sound groups allow you to organize sounds into categories with shared playback limits and "
"collective control.\n"
"Useful for managing weapon sounds, ambient sounds, or dialogue with max audible limits."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_MODE_CREATESTREAM
msgid "Creates a stream for the sound. Audio is decoded on-the-fly, saving memory for large files."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_stream_from_file/description:4
msgid ""
"Creates a streaming [FmodSound] from a file. Streams decode audio data on-the-fly, which is "
"memory-efficient for large files like background music.\n"
"For [code]res://[/code] paths, the wrapper loads the whole encoded file into memory and retains "
"it for the lifetime of the sound; decoding still happens as a stream.\n"
"The mode parameter specifies creation options using [enum FmodMode] flags."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:create_layout_from_godot/description:1
msgid ""
"Creates an independent configuration from the current Godot AudioServer buses and supported "
"effects. Unsupported effects are skipped. This does not activate or save the result. The Dock "
"conversion command also reports skipped effects."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:create_system/description:1
msgid ""
"Creates and returns a new, uninitialized [FmodSystem]. Returns [code]null[/code] if creation "
"fails.\n"
"Configure the system as needed, then call [method init] to initialize it.\n"
"To use the system managed by [FmodServer], call [method FmodServer.get_main_system]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:preload/description:1
msgid ""
"Creates the internal [FmodSound] immediately using the current [member mode_flags].\n"
"Use this before playback to move FMOD sound creation and stream prebuffering out of the first "
