#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:init/description:3
msgid ""
"Initializes a system created by [method create_system].\n"
"[param max_channels] sets the maximum number of simultaneously playing channels and must be "
"greater than [code]0[/code].\n"
"[param flags] is a bitmask of [enum FmodInitFlags] values."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/description:1
msgid ""
"Initializes the main [FmodSystem], applies the project's [code]audio/fmod[/code] settings, and "
"updates FMOD once per [SceneTree] process frame. Access the singleton through its static methods."
"\n"
"[method get_audio_bus_layout] returns bus configuration; [method get_audio_bus_by_id] and [method"
" get_bus_effect_instance] return the corresponding runtime objects. Each effect slot has an "
"independent runtime instance. Changes to the active configuration are applied on the next update,"
" or immediately with [method flush_bus_updates].\n"
"With [code]audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses[/code] enabled, Godot's [AudioServer] supplies the "
"configuration. When disabled, the server loads [code]audio/fmod/default_bus_layout[/code], whose "
"default is [code]res://default_fmod_bus_layout.tres[/code]. Changing the synchronization setting "
"requires reloading the project. See [FmodAudioBusLayout] for editing, saving, and the FMOD Audio "
"Dock.\n"
"Performance monitors are available in Godot's [b]Debugger > Monitors[/b] panel.\n"
"[b]Performance Monitors:[/b]\n"
"The following custom monitors are registered with Godot's Performance system:\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/DSP[/code]: DSP processing CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Stream[/code]: Stream decoding CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Geometry[/code]: 3D geometry processing CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Update[/code]: System update CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Convolution1[/code]: Convolution reverb 1 CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodCPUUsage/Convolution2[/code]: Convolution reverb 2 CPU usage percentage\n"
"- [code]FmodFileUsage/SampleBytesRead[/code]: Sample bytes read from disk\n"
"- [code]FmodFileUsage/StreamBytesRead[/code]: Stream bytes read from disk\n"
"- [code]FmodFileUsage/OtherBytesRead[/code]: Other bytes read from disk"
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:init_bus/description:3
