msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/constants:6/constant:FMOD_OUTPUT_TYPE_AUDIOOUT
msgid "PlayStation AudioOut output."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannel/members:4/member:frequency
msgid ""
"Playback frequency in Hz. Changing it affects both playback speed and pitch. Values assigned to "
"this property must be greater than [code]0.0[/code]. A wrapper without a Channel pointer reports "
"[code]0.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_PLAYLIST
msgid "Playlist file format (M3U/PLS)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_TYPE_PLAYLIST
msgid "Playlist file metadata."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/description:1
msgid ""
"Plays [FmodAudioStream] in 3D using FMOD positioning, rolloff, optional Doppler tracking, and an "
"emission cone. Playback controls, pitch, volume, and bus routing are shared with the other FMOD "
"players."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/description:1
msgid ""
"Plays [FmodAudioStream] resources through FMOD with volume in decibels, a pitch multiplier, "
"playback controls, speaker mix targets, and bus routing."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/description:1
msgid ""
"Plays [FmodAudioStream] resources with distance attenuation and stereo panning relative to the 2D"
" listener. Each player uses one playback channel."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:play_dsp/description:4
msgid ""
"Plays a DSP and its input signals on a channel, routed through the specified channel group.\n"
"If paused is [code]true[/code], the channel starts in a paused state and won't produce sound "
"until [method FmodChannelControl.set_paused] is called with [code]false[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:play_sound/description:4
msgid ""
"Plays a sound on a channel, routed through the specified channel group.\n"
"If paused is [code]true[/code], the channel starts in a paused state and won't produce sound "
"until [method FmodChannelControl.set_paused] is called with [code]false[/code].\n"
"Returns a [FmodChannel] handle that can be used to control playback."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:preload_stream/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:preload_stream/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:preload_stream/description:1
msgid ""
"Preloads the assigned stream by creating its internal [FmodSound]. Returns [code]false[/code] if "
"no stream is assigned or sound creation fails."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_SOUND_TYPE_MOD
