#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:get_loop_points/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns a Dictionary containing the loop start and end points.\n"
"The returned Dictionary has two keys:\n"
"- [code]\"start\"[/code]: The loop start position\n"
"- [code]\"end\"[/code]: The loop end position\n"
"The [param timeunit] parameter specifies the unit for these values (milliseconds, PCM samples, "
"etc.).\n"
"See [enum FmodSystem.FmodTimeUnit] for available time units."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:get_max_polygons/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a Dictionary containing the maximum capacity of this geometry object:\n"
"- [code]max_polygons[/code]: Maximum number of polygons this geometry can hold\n"
"- [code]max_vertices[/code]: Maximum number of vertices this geometry can hold\n"
"These values are set when the geometry is created via [method FmodSystem.create_geometry]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_delay/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] containing the current delay settings with the following keys:\n"
"- [code]\"start\"[/code] ([code skip-lint]int[/code]): The DSP clock value when playback should "
"start.\n"
"- [code]\"end\"[/code] ([code skip-lint]int[/code]): The DSP clock value when playback should "
"stop.\n"
"- [code]\"stop_channels\"[/code] ([code skip-lint]bool[/code]): Whether to stop channels when the"
" end time is reached."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_dsp_clock/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a [Dictionary] with the current DSP clock values containing:\n"
"- [code]\"dsp_lock\"[/code] ([code skip-lint]int[/code]): The current DSP clock for this channel."
"\n"
"- [code]\"parent_clock\"[/code] ([code skip-lint]int[/code]): The current DSP clock of the parent"
" ChannelGroup.\n"
"These clock values are used for sample-accurate scheduling operations."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_system_object/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a borrowed wrapper for the parent FMOD system, or [code]null[/code] on failure. The "
"returned wrapper cannot close or release the system."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundLock/methods:3/method:get_data1/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the first portion of the locked data. Returns an empty array after unlocking. "
"Editing the returned array does not modify the sound."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundLock/methods:3/method:get_data2/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the second portion of the locked data, which is present only when the region "
"wraps around the end of the sound buffer. Returns an empty array after unlocking. Editing the "
"returned array does not modify the sound."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_fade_points/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary containing [code]num_points[/code] (int), [code]point_dspclocks[/code] "
"(PackedInt64Array), and [code]point_volumes[/code] (PackedFloat32Array). Matching array indices "
"describe the clock and linear volume of each fade point. Returns an empty dictionary on failure."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_input_channel_format/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary containing the channel format information: [code]num_channels[/code] and "
"[code]speaker_mode[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_format/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary containing the sound's format information with the following keys:\n"
"- [code]type[/code]: The audio format type ([enum FmodSoundType]).\n"
"- [code]format[/code]: The sample format ([enum FmodSoundFormat]).\n"
"- [code]channels[/code]: Number of channels (int).\n"
"- [code]bits[/code]: Bits per sample (int)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_channels_playing/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary with information about currently playing channels.\n"
"The returned dictionary contains:\n"
"- [code]channels[/code]: Total number of channels currently playing (including virtual voices).\n"
"- [code]real_channels[/code]: Number of channels that are actually audible (not virtual)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_num_tags/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a dictionary with metadata tag counts:\n"
"- [code]num_tags[/code]: Total number of tags in the sound.\n"
"- [code]num_tags_updated[/code]: Number of tags that have been updated (for streaming sources).\n"
"\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Use [method get_tag] to retrieve individual tag information."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectRecord/methods:3/method:get_recording/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns a new [AudioStreamWAV] containing a copy of the captured samples, or [code]null[/code] if"
" no audio has been recorded. It does not consume or clear the recording. Stop recording first "
"when a completed recording is required."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_sync_point/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns a sync point handle at the specified index. Sync points are embedded markers in audio "
"files (e.g., loop points in WAV or cue points).\n"
"\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Use [method get_sync_point_info] to get information about the returned sync point "
"handle."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectRecord/methods:3/method:get_waveform_snapshot/description:3
msgid ""
"Returns a waveform envelope for the latest [param seconds] of recorded audio. A nonpositive "
"duration uses the entire recording. For each of [param width] horizontal buckets, two [Vector2] "
"elements contain the normalized x position and the minimum or maximum sample value, in that "
"order. Channels are averaged and amplitudes are clamped to -1.0 through 1.0. Returns an empty "
"array for a nonpositive width or no recorded audio; otherwise the array has [code]width * "
"2[/code] elements."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:get_state/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns an ordered array of bus dictionaries containing [code]id[/code], [code]name[/code], "
"[code]send_id[/code], [code]volume_db[/code], [code]solo[/code], [code]mute[/code], "
"[code]bypass_fx[/code], and [code]effects[/code]. Each effect dictionary contains "
"[code]id[/code], [code]effect[/code], and [code]enabled[/code]. Effect resources are shared "
"references. Use with [method set_state] for structural undo and redo."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/methods:3/method:get_bin_count/description:1
msgid "Returns bin count."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:get_bus_names/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns bus names in the active FMOD layout display order. The three FmodAudioStreamPlayer node "
"classes use this list for their Bus property."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/methods:3/method:get_centroid/description:1
msgid "Returns centroid."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_file_usage/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns file I/O statistics.\n"
"The returned dictionary contains:\n"
"- [code]sample_bytes_read[/code]: Bytes read for sample data.\n"
"- [code]stream_bytes_read[/code]: Bytes read for streaming data.\n"
"- [code]other_bytes_read[/code]: Bytes read for other purposes."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/methods:3/method:get_gain/description:1
msgid "Returns gain."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectReverb/methods:3/method:get_hpf/description:1
msgid "Returns hpf."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_record_driver_info/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns identification information for a recording device specified by its index.\n"
"The returned dictionary contains:\n"
"- [code skip-lint]name[/code]: The name of the recording device.\n"
"- [code]guid[/code]: The unique identifier of the device.\n"
"- [code]system_rate[/code]: The default sample rate.\n"
"- [code]speaker_mode[/code]: The speaker mode ([enum FmodSpeakerMode]).\n"
"- [code]speaker_mode_channels[/code]: Number of channels.\n"
"- [code]state[/code]: Driver state flags."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_driver_info/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns identification information for a sound device specified by its index.\n"
"The returned dictionary contains:\n"
"- [code skip-lint]name[/code]: The name of the device.\n"
"- [code]guid[/code]: The unique identifier of the device.\n"
"- [code]system_rate[/code]: The default sample rate of the device.\n"
"- [code]speaker_mode[/code]: The default speaker mode ([enum FmodSpeakerMode]).\n"
"- [code]speaker_mode_channels[/code]: Number of channels in the default speaker mode."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_sync_point_info/description:3
msgid ""
"Returns information about a sync point. The [code skip-lint]point[/code] parameter should be a "
"handle obtained from [method get_sync_point]. Returns a dictionary with:\n"
"- [code skip-lint]name[/code]: Name of the sync point.\n"
"- [code]offset[/code]: Position of the sync point in the specified time units.\n"
"- [code skip-lint]time_unit[/code]: The time unit used for the offset.\n"
"- [code]id[/code]: The opaque sync point handle."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_record_num_drivers/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns information about available recording devices.\n"
"The returned dictionary contains:\n"
"- [code]num_drivers[/code]: Total number of recording devices available.\n"
"- [code]num_connected[/code]: Number of currently connected recording devices."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_metering_enabled/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns metering enabled state for input and output signals. Contains [code]input_enabled[/code] "
"and [code]output_enabled[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_metering_info/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns metering information for input and output signals. Contains [code]input[/code] and "
"[code]output[/code] dictionaries with peak and RMS levels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_nonblock_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns nonblock callback."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_pcmread_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns pcmread callback."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_pcmsetpos_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns pcmsetpos callback."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_properties/description:1
msgid "Returns properties."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/methods:3/method:get_rms/description:1
msgid "Returns rms."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:get_bus_ids/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns stable bus IDs in display order. Master is always the first item with ID [code]0[/code]. "
"IDs are not array indices."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:get_bus_effect_ids/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns stable slot IDs for bus [param bus_id] in processing order, or an empty array for an "
"unknown bus."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_attributes/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the 3D attributes as a Dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]pos[/code]: Current position (Vector3)\n"
"- [code]vel[/code]: Current velocity (Vector3)"
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_3d_listener_attributes/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the 3D attributes of the specified listener as a Dictionary:\n"
"- [code]position[/code]: World position (Vector3)\n"
"- [code]velocity[/code]: Velocity (Vector3)\n"
"- [code]forward[/code]: Forward direction (Vector3)\n"
"- [code]up[/code]: Up direction (Vector3)"
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_3d_attributes/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the 3D attributes of this reverb zone as a Dictionary:\n"
"- [code]position[/code]: Position of the reverb center (Vector3)\n"
"- [code]min_distance[/code]: Minimum distance for full reverb effect (float)\n"
"- [code]max_distance[/code]: Maximum distance where reverb fades to zero (float)"
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_dsp_buffer_pool_size/description:1
msgid "Returns the DSP buffer pool size."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_version/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the FMOD version information.\n"
"The returned dictionary contains:\n"
"- [code]version[/code]: The FMOD version string in format \"product.major.minor\".\n"
"- [code]build_number[/code]: The FMOD build number string."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:find_bus_id/description:2
msgid "Returns the ID of the bus named [param name], or [code]-1[/code] when it does not exist."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/methods:3/method:get_band_q/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the Q value (quality factor) for the specified band. Higher Q values result in a narrower"
" bandwidth."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_network_proxy/description:1
msgid "Returns the URL of the proxy server used for internet streaming connections."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:get_effect/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the [FmodAudioEffect] at the specified [param index] in the effect chain.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if the index is out of bounds."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:get_stream/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_stream/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_stream/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the [FmodAudioStream] currently assigned to this player.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if no stream is set."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioPreviewProperty/methods:3/method:get_stream/description:1
msgid "Returns the [FmodAudioStream] currently being previewed."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:get_bus/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the [FmodChannelGroup] used by this bus for audio routing.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if the bus has not been initialized."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:get_channel/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the [FmodChannel] at the specified [param index] that is feeding into this group.\n"
"The index ranges from 0 to [method get_num_channels] - 1.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if the index is out of bounds or the channel group is invalid."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:get_sound/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the [FmodSound] at the specified [param index] in this group.\n"
"The index ranges from 0 to [method get_num_sounds] - 1.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if the index is out of bounds."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:get_current_sound/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the [FmodSound] currently playing on this channel.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if no sound is playing or the channel is invalid.\n"
"This allows you to retrieve information about the playing sound, such as its length or format."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:get_sound/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the [FmodSound] object for this stream, creating it if necessary (lazy creation). The "
"sound is created using the current [member mode_flags] settings. If the mode flags have changed "
"since the last call, the sound will be recreated with the new settings.\n"
"Returns an empty reference if no audio data is loaded or if the FMOD system is not available."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_emission_angle_filter_attenuation_db/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the attenuation outside the emission cone in dB.\n"
"The default value is [code]-12.0[/code] dB."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:get_polygon_attributes/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the attributes of the specified polygon as a Dictionary:\n"
"- [code]direct_occlusion[/code]: Direct sound occlusion factor (0.0-1.0)\n"
"- [code]reverb_occlusion[/code]: Reverb occlusion factor (0.0-1.0)\n"
"- [code]double_sided[/code]: Whether the polygon is double-sided\n"
"Returns an empty Dictionary if the polygon index is invalid."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:get_voice_delay_ms/description:2
msgid "Returns the base delay time in milliseconds for the specified voice."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_create_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_create_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_getparam_bool_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_getparam_bool_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_getparam_data_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_getparam_data_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_getparam_float_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_getparam_float_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_getparam_int_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_getparam_int_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_release_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_release_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_reset_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_reset_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_setparam_bool_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_setparam_bool_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_setparam_data_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_setparam_data_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_setparam_float_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_setparam_float_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_setparam_int_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_setparam_int_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_setposition_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the callback assigned by [method set_setposition_callback]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/methods:3/method:get_band_frequency/description:2
msgid "Returns the center frequency (in Hz) for the specified band."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:get_group/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the child [FmodChannelGroup] at the specified [param index] that is feeding into this "
"group.\n"
"The index ranges from 0 to [method get_num_groups] - 1.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if the index is out of bounds or the channel group is invalid.\n"
"Use this to traverse the channel group hierarchy."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_cone_settings/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the cone settings as a Dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]inside_cone_angle[/code]: Inside cone angle in degrees\n"
"- [code]outside_cone_angle[/code]: Outside cone angle in degrees\n"
"- [code]outside_volume_db[/code]: Outside volume in dB"
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:get_bus_effect/description:3
msgid ""
"Returns the configuration resource for slot [param slot_id] on bus [param bus_id], or "
"[code]null[/code]. Use [method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] to access live Capture, "
"SpectrumAnalyzer, or Record data."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_profile_port/description:1
msgid "Returns the configured FMOD Profiler port."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_active/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the configured active state. Check [method reverb_3d_is_valid] separately to determine "
"whether this wrapper holds a reverb handle."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:is_bus_bypass/description:2
msgid "Returns the configured bypass flag of bus [param id], or [code]false[/code] for an unknown ID."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:is_bus_effect_enabled/description:3
msgid ""
"Returns the configured enabled flag of slot [param slot_id] on bus [param bus_id], or "
"[code]false[/code] for unknown IDs."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:is_bus_mute/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the configured mute flag of bus [param id]. This excludes muting caused by Solo. Returns "
"[code]false[/code] for an unknown ID."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:is_bus_solo/description:2
msgid "Returns the configured solo flag of bus [param id], or [code]false[/code] for an unknown ID."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:get_bus_volume_db/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the configured volume of bus [param id] in decibels, or [code]0.0[/code] for an unknown "
"ID."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSPConnection/methods:3/method:get_mix_matrix/description:4
msgid ""
"Returns the connection's matrix in row-major order, using [param outchannels] rows and a row "
"stride of [param inchannel_hop], or [param inchannels] when the stride is [code]0[/code]. The "
"array contains [code]outchannels * effective_hop[/code] elements, including zero-filled padding "
"and unused rows or columns.\n"
"Channel counts must be between [code]1[/code] and [code]32[/code]. An explicit stride must be "
"between [param inchannels] and [code]32[/code]. The requested dimensions must hold the actual "
"FMOD matrix; otherwise an empty array is returned and an error is reported.\n"
"FMOD writes into a separate buffer sized for its maximum channel width before values are copied "
"to the returned array. Native dimensions cannot overflow a smaller requested destination."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_level/description:1
msgid "Returns the current 3D panning level."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_reverb_3d_instance/description:1
msgid "Returns the current 3D reverb instance index."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_spread/description:1
msgid "Returns the current 3D spread angle."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_dsp_buffer_size/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current DSP buffer size settings as a Dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]buffer_length[/code]: Length of each buffer in samples\n"
"- [code]num_buffers[/code]: Number of buffers in the ring buffer"
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_attenuation/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current attenuation factor.\n"
"Higher values make the sound fade more quickly with distance."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_attenuation_model/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current attenuation model.\n"
"See [enum AttenuationModel] for possible values."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:get_max_audible_behavior/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current behavior when attempting to play more sounds than [member max_audible] "
"allows.\n"
"See [enum Behavior] for possible values."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_cone_orientation/description:1
msgid "Returns the current cone orientation vector."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:get_audio_bus_layout/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current configuration resource. In independent mode, edits are applied to bound "
"runtime instances on the next server update, or immediately through [method flush_bus_updates]. "
"In synchronization mode Godot AudioServer provides the configuration; edit it through the native "
"Audio panel."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_distance_factor/description:1
msgid "Returns the current distance factor for 3D audio."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:get_mode/description:1
msgid "Returns the current distortion mode."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_doppler_level/description:1
msgid "Returns the current doppler level."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_doppler_scale/description:1
msgid "Returns the current doppler scale factor."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_doppler_tracking/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current doppler tracking mode.\n"
"See [enum DopplerTracking] for possible values."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_mix_matrix/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current final mix matrix as a Dictionary with [code]matrix[/code], "
"[code]outchannels[/code], [code]inchannels[/code], and [code]inchannel_hop[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_low_pass_gain/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current low pass gain value. This controls how much the dry signal is affected when "
"the built-in lowpass filter is applied."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_open_state/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current open state of the sound. This is useful for sounds opened with non-blocking "
"flags or for monitoring streaming buffer status. Returns a dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]open_state[/code]: The current open state ([enum FmodOpenState]).\n"
"- [code]percent_buffered[/code]: Percentage of the buffer filled (0-100) for streaming sounds.\n"
"- [code]starving[/code]: [code]true[/code] if the stream is starving for data (buffer underrun).\n"
"- [code]disk_busy[/code]: [code]true[/code] if the disk is currently busy reading."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_panning_strength/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current panning strength multiplier.\n"
"Higher values create more pronounced left/right panning.\n"
"The default value is [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:get_pitch_scale/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_pitch_scale/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_pitch_scale/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current pitch scale of the audio playback.\n"
"[code]1.0[/code] is the default pitch, [code]0.5[/code] is one octave lower, [code]2.0[/code] is "
"one octave higher."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:get_frequency/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current playback frequency in Hertz (Hz).\n"
"The default frequency is the sample rate of the sound (typically 44100 or 48000 Hz).\n"
"Changing the frequency affects both playback speed and pitch."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_mode/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current playback mode flags that control the behavior of this channel. See [enum "
"FmodSystem.FmodMode] for available mode flags."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:get_position/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the current playback position.\n"
"The [param timeunit] parameter specifies the unit for the returned value:\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS[/code]: Milliseconds (default)\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_PCM[/code]: PCM samples\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_PCMBYTES[/code]: Bytes of PCM data\n"
"- [code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_RAWBYTES[/code]: Raw file bytes\n"
"See [enum FmodSystem.FmodTimeUnit] for all available options."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_random_seed/description:1
msgid "Returns the current random seed."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_record_position/description:2
msgid "Returns the current recording position in PCM samples for the specified recording device."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_pitch/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current relative pitch/playback rate. A value of 1.0 means normal playback speed, "
"values below 1.0 slow down playback, and values above 1.0 speed it up."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_resampler_method/description:1
msgid "Returns the current resampler method."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_rolloff_scale/description:1
msgid "Returns the current rolloff scale factor."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_software_format/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current software format settings as a Dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]sample_rate[/code]: Current sample rate\n"
"- [code]speaker_mode[/code]: Current speaker mode\n"
"- [code]num_raw_speakers[/code]: Number of raw speakers"
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_stream_buffer_size/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current stream buffer size settings as a Dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]file_buffer_size[/code]: Size of the stream buffer\n"
"- [code]file_buffer_size_type[/code]: The time unit used for the buffer size"
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_vol0_virtual_vol/description:1
msgid "Returns the current virtual voice threshold volume."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_volume_linear/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current volume as a linear value (0.0 to 1.0+).\n"
"Converts from the internal dB value."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:get_volume_db/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_volume_db/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_volume_db/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current volume in decibels.\n"
"The default value is [code]0.0[/code] dB (unity gain)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_volume_db/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the current volume level in decibels (dB). 0 dB represents unity gain (no change), "
"negative values attenuate the signal, and positive values amplify it."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_output/description:1
msgid "Returns the currently selected output interface type used to run the mixer."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_custom_rolloff/description:1
msgid "Returns the custom rolloff curve points."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_default_decode_buffer_size/description:1
msgid "Returns the default decode buffer size for streams."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_tap1_delay_ms/description:1
msgid "Returns the delay time for tap 1 in milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_tap2_delay_ms/description:1
msgid "Returns the delay time for tap 2 in milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_feedback_delay_ms/description:1
msgid "Returns the delay time for the feedback loop in milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_distance_filter_center_freq/description:1
msgid "Returns the distance filter center frequency."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_distance_filter/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the distance filter settings as a Dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]custom[/code]: Whether custom filter is enabled\n"
"- [code]custom_level[/code]: Custom filter level\n"
"- [code]center_freq[/code]: Center frequency"
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:get_drive/description:1
msgid "Returns the distortion drive/amount (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:get_dry/description:1
#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_dry/description:1
msgid "Returns the dry (unprocessed) signal level."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_early_late_mix/description:1
msgid "Returns the early/late reflection mix in percent."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_diffusion/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the echo density value (0.0 to 100.0).\n"
"Controls the density of echoes in the late reverb decay. Higher values create a smoother, more "
"dense reverb tail."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:get_mute_fade_speed/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the fade duration in seconds used by [constant BEHAVIOR_MUTE]. A value of "
"[code]0.0[/code] means no fading."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:get_feedback/description:1
msgid "Returns the feedback amount."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/methods:3/method:get_band_filter_type/description:2
msgid "Returns the filter type for the specified band. See [enum FilterType] for possible values."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:get_depth/description:1
msgid "Returns the filtered signal gain added to the original signal."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/methods:3/method:get_band_gain_db/description:2
msgid "Returns the gain (in dB) for the specified band. The value ranges from -60 dB to +24 dB."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:get_channel_group/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the group wrapper last assigned through [method set_channel_group], or [code]null[/code] "
"if no group is cached. This method does not query the current routing from FMOD."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_high_cut/description:1
msgid "Returns the high-cut frequency in Hz."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:get_keep_hf_hz/description:1
msgid "Returns the high-frequency preservation cutoff in Hertz."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_hf_decay_ratio/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the high-frequency to mid-frequency decay-time ratio in percent, from [code]10.0[/code] "
"to [code]200.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_driver/description:1
msgid "Returns the index of the currently selected output driver for the active output type."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_dsp_index/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the index of the specified DSP unit in the DSP chain, or -1 if the DSP is not found in "
"the chain."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:get_index/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the index of this channel in the system channel pool.\n"
"Each channel has a unique index from 0 to the maximum number of channels minus 1.\n"
"Returns [code]-1[/code] if the channel is invalid."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_early_delay/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the initial reflection delay time in milliseconds.\n"
"This is the time between the direct sound and the first reflections."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_emission_angle/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the inner emission angle in degrees.\n"
"Sound is at full volume within this cone.\n"
"The default value is [code]45.0[/code] degrees."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_stream_playback/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the internal [FmodChannel] used for playback.\n"
"Returns [code]null[/code] if no channel is active.\n"
"This can be used for advanced control over the playing sound."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/methods:3/method:get_geometry/description:1
msgid "Returns the internal [FmodGeometry], or [code]null[/code] when no geometry has been built."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverbZone3D/methods:3/method:get_reverb/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the internal low-level [FmodReverb3D] object, or [code]null[/code] if it has not been "
"created."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_late_delay/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the late reverb delay time in milliseconds.\n"
"This is the time between the early reflections and the onset of the late reverb tail."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:get_length/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the length of the audio in seconds. Returns [code]0.0[/code] if the sound has not been "
"created or if no data is loaded."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_length/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the length of the sound in the specified time units. When using milliseconds "
"([code]FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS[/code]), the result is returned in seconds. For other units like bytes "
"or PCM samples, the raw value is returned.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] See [enum FmodSystem.FmodTimeUnit] for available time unit options."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:get_bus_effect_instance/description:3
msgid ""
"Returns the live effect instance of [param slot_id] on [param bus_id], or [code]null[/code] if "
"the bus or slot has no applied runtime instance. After adding a slot, call [method "
"flush_bus_updates] before requesting it in the same frame. Use this instance for "
"[FmodAudioEffectCapture] buffers, [FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer] snapshots, and "
"[FmodAudioEffectRecord] output. Each slot has its own instance, even when slots share a "
"configuration resource. Runtime edits are not saved; subsequent configuration edits may update "
"the instance."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_low_shelf_gain/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the low shelf gain in dB.\n"
"Controls the relative room effect level for low frequencies."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_feedback_lowpass/description:1
msgid "Returns the lowpass filter cutoff frequency for the feedback loop."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:get_voice_cutoff_hz/description:2
msgid "Returns the lowpass filter cutoff frequency for the specified voice."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/methods:3/method:get_magnitude_for_frequency_range/description:4
msgid ""
"Returns the magnitude (amplitude) of the specified frequency range as a [Vector2]. The "
"[code]x[/code] component contains the left channel magnitude and [code]y[/code] contains the "
"right channel magnitude.\n"
"The [param begin] and [param end] parameters specify the frequency range in Hz (e.g., 20.0 to "
"200.0 for bass frequencies). The [param mode] determines how the magnitude is calculated across "
"the range: [constant MAGNITUDE_AVERAGE] calculates the average magnitude, while [constant "
"MAGNITUDE_MAX] returns the peak magnitude.\n"
"Magnitude values are in linear scale (0.0 to 1.0+). Use [code]linear_to_db()[/code] to convert to"
" decibels for display purposes."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:get_main_system/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the main FMOD System instance. This is the primary interface for creating sounds, "
"channels, DSP effects, and other FMOD objects. The system is automatically initialized during "
"server startup with settings from ProjectSettings."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:get_master_channel_group/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the master channel group that all sounds route through by default. This is the root of "
"the channel group hierarchy and can be used to control global volume, pitch, and effects for all "
"playing sounds."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_master_channel_group/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the master channel group to which all sounds ultimately route. Use this to control global"
" volume, add master effects, or monitor overall output."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_master_sound_group/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the master sound group that all sounds belong to by default.\n"
"The master sound group can be used to set global playback limits and control collective behavior "
"for all sounds."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/constants:6/constant:MAGNITUDE_MAX
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum (peak) magnitude within the specified frequency range. This provides a more "
"responsive visualization that highlights the strongest frequencies in the range."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_max_distance/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum 3D distance."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:get_range_max_hz/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum frequency of the LFO sweep in Hertz."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_geometry_max_fade_time/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum geometry occlusion fade time."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_max_adpcm_codecs/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of allocated ADPCM codecs."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_max_at9_codecs/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of allocated AT9 codecs."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_max_fadpcm_codecs/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of allocated FADPCM codecs."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_max_mpeg_codecs/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of allocated MPEG codecs."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_max_opus_codecs/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of allocated Opus codecs."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_max_vorbis_codecs/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of allocated Vorbis codecs."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_max_xma_codecs/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of allocated XMA codecs."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_max_convolution_threads/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of convolution threads."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:get_max_audible/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum number of simultaneous audible playbacks. FMOD returns [code]-1[/code] for an"
" unlimited group. Returns [code]0[/code] if this wrapper has no sound group or the query fails."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_software_channels/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of software channels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_max_spatial_objects/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum number of spatial objects."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_max_distance/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum rolloff distance multiplier. Multiply it by [member unit_size] to obtain the "
"distance passed to FMOD.\n"
"In [constant ATTENUATION_DISABLED] mode, a flat custom rolloff curve keeps distance gain at unity"
" regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_3d_max_world_size/description:1
msgid "Returns the maximum world size for 3D spatial audio."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_min_distance/description:1
msgid "Returns the minimum 3D distance."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:get_range_min_hz/description:1
msgid "Returns the minimum frequency of the LFO sweep in Hertz."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_unit_size/description:1
msgid "Returns the minimum rolloff distance in scene units."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:get_mix_target/description:1
msgid "Returns the mix target used to route this player's output across available speakers."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_density/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the modal density of the late reverb in percent, from [code]0.0[/code] to "
"[code]100.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:get_voice_depth_ms/description:2
msgid "Returns the modulation depth in milliseconds for the specified voice."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:get_voice_rate_hz/description:2
msgid "Returns the modulation rate in Hertz for the specified voice."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectPhaser/methods:3/method:get_rate_hz/description:1
msgid "Returns the modulation rate in Hertz."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:get_bus_name/description:2
msgid "Returns the name of bus [param id], or an empty [StringName] for an unknown ID."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:get_bus/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_bus/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_bus/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the audio bus this player outputs to.\n"
"The default value is [code]&\"Master\"[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_name/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the sound. This is typically the filename or a name embedded in the audio "
"file."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:get_name/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the name of this ChannelGroup as specified when it was created.\n"
"Returns an empty string if the channel group is invalid.\n"
"Channel group names are useful for identification and debugging purposes."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:get_name/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the name of this SoundGroup as specified when it was created.\n"
"Returns an empty string if the sound group is invalid."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:get_bus_name/description:1
msgid "Returns the name of this audio bus."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_num_dsps/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of DSP units currently in the DSP chain for this channel."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_3d_num_listeners/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of active 3D listeners."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:get_voice_count/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of active chorus voices (1-4)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_num_drivers/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of available output drivers for the currently selected output type."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectEQ/methods:3/method:get_band_count/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of bands in this equalizer, which depends on the preset (6, 10, or 21)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:get_num_channels/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of channels currently feeding into this ChannelGroup.\n"
"Returns [code]-1[/code] if the channel group is invalid.\n"
"This count includes only direct channel inputs, not channels in nested groups."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:get_num_playing/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of channels currently playing sounds from this SoundGroup.\n"
"Returns [code]0[/code] if the sound group is invalid."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_speaker_mode_channels/description:2
msgid "Returns the number of channels for the specified speaker mode."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_music_num_channels/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of channels in a MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI file. Each channel corresponds to a "
"track/instrument in the module file.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only works for module music formats (tracker formats)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:get_num_groups/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of child ChannelGroups currently feeding into this group.\n"
"Returns [code]0[/code] if the channel group is invalid.\n"
"This count represents the number of nested channel groups that have been added via [method "
"add_group]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectCapture/methods:3/method:get_frames_available/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of complete stereo frames currently queued. This is the number of [Vector2] "
"elements that can be read, rather than the number of individual channel samples."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_asio_num_channels/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of configured ASIO channels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:get_bus_count/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of configured buses, including Master."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:get_effect_count/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of effect instances stored on this runtime bus. Use [method "
"FmodAudioBusLayout.get_bus_effect_ids] for stable slot IDs."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectCapture/methods:3/method:get_pushed_frames/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of frames submitted by the audio callback, including frames that were "
"discarded. Reading does not reset this counter; [method clear_buffer] and detaching the effect "
"reset it."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectCapture/methods:3/method:get_discarded_frames/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of incoming frames dropped because the buffer was full. The unread frames "
"already in the queue are preserved. Reading does not reset this counter; [method clear_buffer] "
"and detaching the effect reset it."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_num_inputs/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of input DSP connections."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_num_outputs/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of output DSP connections."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_num_parameters/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of parameters exposed by this DSP unit."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/methods:3/method:get_polygon_count/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of polygons successfully added to FMOD."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:get_num_sounds/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of sounds that belong to this SoundGroup.\n"
"Returns [code]0[/code] if the sound group is invalid."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_num_sub_sounds/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of sub-sounds in a multi-sound file. This is useful for formats like FSB (FMOD"
" Sound Bank) or DLS (Downloadable Sounds) that contain multiple audio samples.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] Regular audio files like MP3 or WAV typically return 0 for this value."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_num_sync_points/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of sync points in the sound. This includes both sync points embedded in the "
"audio file (e.g., cue points) and ones added with [method add_sync_point]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:get_loop_count/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the number of times the sound will loop before stopping.\n"
"[b]Values:[/b]\n"
"- [code]-1[/code]: Infinite looping\n"
"- [code]0[/code]: Play once (no looping)\n"
"- [code]1[/code]: Play twice (one loop)\n"
"- [code]n[/code]: Play n+1 times"
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:get_polygon_num_vertices/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the number of vertices in the specified polygon, or [code]0[/code] if the geometry or "
"index is invalid or the query fails."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/methods:3/method:get_vertex_count/description:1
msgid "Returns the number of vertices successfully added to FMOD."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_3d_occlusion/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the occlusion values as a Dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]direct_occlusion[/code]: Direct path occlusion (0.0-1.0)\n"
"- [code]reverb_occlusion[/code]: Reverb path occlusion (0.0-1.0)"
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_tap1_level_db/description:1
msgid "Returns the output level for tap 1 in decibels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_tap2_level_db/description:1
msgid "Returns the output level for tap 2 in decibels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:get_voice_level_db/description:2
msgid "Returns the output level in decibels for the specified voice."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_feedback_level_db/description:1
msgid "Returns the output level of the feedback loop in decibels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_output_handle/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the output type-specific native handle. For Windows, this is typically a WASAPI or "
"DirectSound device handle."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:get_oversample/description:1
msgid "Returns the oversampling factor."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelGroup/methods:3/method:get_parent_group/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the parent [FmodChannelGroup] that this group outputs to, including the master group when"
" it is the parent. Returns [code]null[/code] if there is no parent or the query fails."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:get_parent/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the parent stored by [method init_bus] or [method set_parent]. To inspect routing changed"
" directly through the channel group, use [method FmodChannelGroup.get_parent_group] on [method "
"get_bus]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStream/methods:3/method:get_resampler_method/description:1
msgid "Returns the per-sound resampler."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:get_playback_position/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_playback_position/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_playback_position/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the playback position in seconds, including while paused. Returns [code]0.0[/code] if "
"there is no valid playback channel."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:get_polygon_vertex/description:3
msgid ""
"Returns the position of a specific vertex in a polygon.\n"
"- [param index]: The polygon index\n"
"- [param vertex_index]: The vertex index within the polygon (0 to [method "
"get_polygon_num_vertices] - 1)\n"
"Returns [code]Vector3(0, 0, 0)[/code] if either index is invalid."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_speaker_position/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the position of the specified speaker as a Dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]x[/code]: X coordinate\n"
"- [code]y[/code]: Y coordinate\n"
"- [code]active[/code]: Whether the speaker is active"
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:get_position/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the position of this geometry object in world space.\n"
"The position is applied to all polygons in the geometry."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:get_post_gain/description:1
msgid "Returns the post-distortion gain in decibels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDistortion/methods:3/method:get_pre_gain/description:1
msgid "Returns the pre-distortion gain in decibels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_process_callback/description:1
msgid "Returns the process callback."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_hf_reference/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the reference high frequency in Hz.\n"
"Frequencies above this value are affected by the HF decay ratio."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_low_shelf_frequency/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the reference low frequency in Hz.\n"
"Frequencies below this value are affected by the low shelf gain."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_music_speed/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the relative playback speed of MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI music. A value of 1.0 represents normal"
" speed, values less than 1.0 are slower, and values greater than 1.0 are faster.\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only works for module music formats."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_reverb_properties/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the reverb properties for the specified global reverb instance as a Dictionary with all "
"parameters."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_decay_time/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the reverberation decay time in milliseconds.\n"
"This is the time it takes for the reverb to decay by 60dB."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:get_audio_bus/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the runtime bus named [param name], or [code]null[/code] when it does not exist. After "
"adding a bus, call [method flush_bus_updates] before requesting it in the same frame. Direct "
"runtime edits do not modify or save the layout configuration."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:get_audio_bus_by_id/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the runtime bus with stable [param id], or [code]null[/code]. Bus IDs remain stable when "
"the layout is reordered or a bus is renamed."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:get_scale/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the scale of this geometry object.\n"
"The scale is applied to all polygons in the geometry."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:get_bus_send/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the send target ID of bus [param id], or [code]-1[/code] for an unknown ID. Master "
"returns [code]0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:get_save_size/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the serialized size in bytes, or [code]0[/code] on failure. [method save] allocates its "
"output buffer automatically."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_defaults/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the sound's default playback attributes, which are used as the initial values for "
"channels playing this sound. Returns a dictionary with:\n"
"- [code]frequency[/code]: Default playback frequency in Hz (float).\n"
"- [code]priority[/code]: Default priority (int, 0 to 256, where 0 is most important)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodServer/methods:3/method:is_syncing_godot_buses/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the startup value of [code]audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses[/code]. Changing this "
"project setting requires reloading the project."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_tap1_pan/description:1
msgid "Returns the stereo panning position for tap 1 (-1.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectDelay/methods:3/method:get_tap2_pan/description:1
msgid "Returns the stereo panning position for tap 2 (-1.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:get_voice_pan/description:2
msgid "Returns the stereo panning position for the specified voice (-1.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_area_mask/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:get_area_mask/description:1
msgid "Returns the stored area mask. It currently has no effect on playback."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:get_max_polyphony/description:1
msgid "Returns the stored requested voice limit. The player currently uses only one playback channel."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:is_bypass/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the stored runtime bypass flag. [method sync_bypass] applies it to this bus's effect "
"instances."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:is_solo/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the stored solo flag, independently of the user mute flag. Use [method "
"FmodAudioBusLayout.set_bus_solo] to apply solo muting across the layout."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:is_mute/description:1
msgid "Returns the stored user mute flag. A bus can also be muted by another bus's solo state."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:get_network_timeout/description:1
msgid "Returns the timeout in milliseconds for network streams."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:get_priority/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the virtual voice priority of this channel.\n"
"Priority values range from 0 (highest) to 256 (lowest).\n"
"When FMOD's virtual voice system needs to steal voices, lower priority channels are virtualized "
"first."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/methods:3/method:get_music_channel_volume/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the volume of a specific channel in a MOD/S3M/XM/IT/MIDI file, in decibels (dB).\n"
"[b]Note:[/b] This only works for module music formats. Use [method get_music_num_channels] to get"
" the number of available channels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSoundGroup/methods:3/method:get_volume_db/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the volume of this SoundGroup in decibels.\n"
"Returns [code]0.0[/code] if the sound group is invalid.\n"
"This volume affects all sounds belonging to the group."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/methods:3/method:get_volume_db/description:1
msgid "Returns the volume of this bus in decibels."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectChorus/methods:3/method:get_wet/description:1
msgid "Returns the wet (processed) signal level."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/methods:3/method:get_wet_level/description:1
msgid ""
"Returns the wet signal level in dB.\n"
"Controls the overall reverb output level relative to the dry signal."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannelControl/methods:3/method:get_reverb_properties/description:2
msgid ""
"Returns the wet/send level for the specified reverb instance (0-3). This controls how much of the"
" channel's audio is sent to the reverb effect."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometry/methods:3/method:get_rotation/description:1
msgid "Returns the world-space Euler rotation in radians."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectCompressor/methods:3/method:get_threshold/description:1
msgid "Returns threshold."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectStereoEnhance/methods:3/method:get_time_pullout/description:1
msgid "Returns time pullout."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/methods:3/method:is_autoplay_enabled/description:1
#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D/methods:3/method:is_autoplay_enabled/description:1
msgid "Returns whether [member auto_play] is enabled."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D/methods:3/method:is_autoplay_enabled/description:1
msgid "Returns whether [member autoplay] is enabled."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:can_send_to/description:3
msgid ""
"Returns whether bus [param id] can send to [param target]. Both buses must exist. Master sends to"
" the output device; self-sends and cycles are rejected. Display order does not restrict sends."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioEffectSpectrumAnalyzer/methods:3/method:get_immediate_mode/description:1
msgid "Returns whether immediate FFT mode is enabled."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_idle/description:1
msgid "Returns whether the DSP is currently idle (not processing any audible input)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/methods:3/method:has_valid_geometry/description:1
msgid "Returns whether the internal FMOD geometry object exists."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_active/description:1
msgid "Returns whether this DSP is currently active (processing)."
msgstr ""

#. FmodDSP/methods:3/method:get_bypass/description:1
msgid "Returns whether this DSP is currently bypassed."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverbZone3D/members:4/member:decay_time
msgid "Reverb decay time in milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#. FmodGeometryInstance3D/members:4/member:reverb_occlusion
msgid "Reverb occlusion factor from [code]0.0[/code] to [code]1.0[/code]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverb3D/members:4/member:decay_time
msgid "Reverberation decay time in milliseconds."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/constants:6/constant:MIX_TARGET_SURROUND
msgid "Route audio to all available surround speaker positions."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/constants:6/constant:MIX_TARGET_CENTER
msgid "Route audio to the center and LFE speakers."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioStreamPlayer/constants:6/constant:MIX_TARGET_STEREO
msgid "Route audio to the front left and front right speakers."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBusLayout/methods:3/method:set_bus_send/description:3
msgid ""
"Routes bus [param id] to [param target]. Returns [constant OK] on success or [constant "
"ERR_INVALID_PARAMETER] when [method can_send_to] rejects the route."
msgstr ""

#. FmodChannel/methods:3/method:set_channel_group/description:2
msgid ""
"Routes this channel to the supplied [FmodChannelGroup] and stores that wrapper for [method "
"get_channel_group]. The group must be non-null and contain a valid FMOD handle."
msgstr ""

#. FmodAudioBus/description:1
msgid ""
"Runtime mixing bus backed by an FMOD channel group. [FmodServer] owns buses for the active "
"[FmodAudioBusLayout]; obtain them with [method FmodServer.get_audio_bus] or [method "
"FmodServer.get_audio_bus_by_id]. The server manages their lifetime.\n"
"Use [FmodAudioBusLayout] to author routing, mixing state, and effect slots. Direct changes to "
"this runtime object do not modify or save the layout. Managed effect instances are per slot; "
"[method FmodServer.get_bus_effect_instance] provides access by stable IDs.\n"
"Standalone buses created with [method init_bus] remain available for low-level routing. Their "
"lifetime and effects are managed by the caller."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSound/constants:6/constant:FMOD_TAG_TYPE_SHOUTCAST
msgid "SHOUTcast stream metadata."
msgstr ""

#. FmodReverbZone3D/brief_description:0
msgid "Scene node wrapper for an FMOD 3D reverb zone."
msgstr ""

