"Starts or stops recording. Changing from inactive to active clears the previous recording and "
"allocates a new capture buffer. Setting the current state again does nothing. Stopping preserves "
"captured samples for [method get_recording]."
msgstr ""

#. FmodSystem/methods:3/method:record_start/description:4
msgid ""
"Starts recording from the specified device into the provided sound object.\n"
"If loop is [code]true[/code], recording will wrap around to the beginning of the sound buffer "
"when it reaches the end."
msgstr ""

